    "sourceFile": "src/codeCatalog/lcs/langs/Lcs.java",
    "source": "/** LCS DP + reconstruct — complete Java reference. */\npublic final class Lcs {\n  public record Result(int length, String sequence) {}\n\n  public static Result lcs(String X, String Y) {\n    int m = X.length();\n    int n = Y.length();\n    int[][] dp = new int[m + 1][n + 1];\n    for (int i = 0; i <= m; i++) dp[i][0] = 0;\n    for (int j = 0; j <= n; j++) dp[0][j] = 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n      for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n        if (X.charAt(i - 1) == Y.charAt(j - 1)) {\n          dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1;\n        } else {\n          dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    int i = m;\n    int j = n;\n    StringBuilder chars = new StringBuilder();\n    while (i > 0 && j > 0) {\n      if (X.charAt(i - 1) == Y.charAt(j - 1)) {\n        chars.append(X.charAt(i - 1));\n        i--;\n        j--;\n      } else if (dp[i - 1][j] >= dp[i][j - 1]) {\n        i--;\n      } else {\n        j--;\n      }\n    }\n    return new Result(dp[m][n], chars.reverse().toString());\n  }\n}\n",
